{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17496","headline":"夜泊有怀 · 权德舆","name":"夜泊有怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"栖鸟向前林，暝色生寒芜。\n孤舟去不息，衆感非一途。\n川程方浩淼，离思方郁纡。\n转枕眼未熟，拥衾泪已濡。\n窘然风水上，寝食疲朝晡。\n心想洞房夜，知君还向隅。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17496.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17496","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}